      "writtenOn": "2017-11-29T23:47:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think we want to check if the foreground is active. The bug occurred because the foreground was switched twice. \n\nThe test flow should be:\n1. We currently have a call A.\n2. There is an incoming call B, and we try to hold A but failed.\n3. Terminated call B and resume the foreground call. \n4. Check if the foreground is ACTIVE.",
      "range": {
